.DS_Store

# The Sparkle private key, if it is ever exported here. It must never be public.
slate-update-key.txt
*.private

# The download itself is deliberately NOT committed yet. The DMG on disk is
# signed with an Apple Development certificate and has not been notarized, so
# Gatekeeper blocks it on every Mac but this one. Publishing it would put a
# broken download on slatedictation.com and keep it in git history forever.
#
# Once `cd ~/Desktop/Blue/Slate && scripts/notarize.sh` has produced a stapled
# Developer ID build and you have copied it here, DELETE THE LINE BELOW and
# commit the DMG. The download button will 404 until you do.
Slate-*.dmg
